Add driver for the Parade PS5169, an USB Type-C redriver capable of
handling 10Gb/s USB signals and 8.1Gb/s DisplayPort signals.

Signed-off-by: Esteban Urrutia <esteuwu@proton.me>
---
 MAINTAINERS                    |   7 +
